"\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n      \"mainEntity\": [\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"Does Soie Clinic have a FineXel device?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"Yes. The video shows our FineXel fractional CO2 laser at Soie Clinic. Contact us to confirm the branch and arrange a consultation.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What is fractional CO2 laser?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"It is a skin resurfacing treatment that applies CO2 laser energy to small areas in a pattern, leaving skin between them untreated. The treatment settings are chosen after a medical assessment.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What can fractional CO2 laser help with?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"It may be considered for certain acne scars, uneven texture and fine lines. Suitability depends on the concern and your skin. Results vary, and more than one session may be needed.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"How much recovery time will I need?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"Recovery depends on the treatment depth, area and your skin. Redness, swelling, peeling and sensitivity can last for several days, with redness sometimes lasting longer. We will discuss timing and aftercare before you book.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"Is fractional CO2 laser suitable for everyone?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"No. We review your skin tone, healing history, medicines and recent procedures. Tell us about active skin infections, cold sores, pregnancy and recent tanning. We will explain possible risks, including pigment changes and scarring, and whether another approach would suit you.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"How many FineXel sessions will I need?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"There is no single course for everyone. We suggest a plan after assessing your skin and goals, then review your response before recommending further sessions.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"How much does fractional CO2 laser cost in Cairo?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"The price depends on the area and the treatment plan recommended after assessing your skin. Contact Soie Clinic for current costs, branch availability and advice on planning your recovery.\"\n          }\n        }\n      ],\n      \"@id\": \"{{origin}}/devices/finexel-fractional-co2#faq\",\n      \"url\": \"{{origin}}/devices/finexel-fractional-co2#device-faq\",\n      \"isPartOf\": {\n        \"@id\": \"{{origin}}/devices/finexel-fractional-co2#page\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\",\n      \"@id\": \"{{origin}}/devices/finexel-fractional-co2#breadcrumbs\",\n      \"itemListElement\": [\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n          \"position\": 1,\n          \"name\": \"Home\",\n          \"item\": \"{{origin}}/\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n          \"position\": 2,\n          \"name\": \"Devices\",\n          \"item\": \"{{origin}}/devices\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n          \"position\": 3,\n          \"name\": \"FineXel CO2\",\n          \"item\": \"{{origin}}/devices/finexel-fractional-co2\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"VideoObject\",\n      \"@id\": \"{{origin}}/devices/finexel-fractional-co2#video\",\n      \"name\": \"FineXel fractional CO2 laser session at Soie Clinic\",\n      \"description\": \"FineXel fractional CO2 laser session at Soie Clinic\",\n      \"thumbnailUrl\": \"{{origin}}/assets/videos/posters/finexel-fractional-co2.jpg\",\n      \"contentUrl\": \"{{origin}}/assets/videos/finexel-fractional-co2.mp4\",\n      \"uploadDate\": \"2026-10-25T15:37:27Z\",\n      \"duration\": \"PT10.666667S\",\n      \"publisher\": {\n        \"@id\": \"{{origin}}/#clinic\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"MedicalClinic\",\n      \"@id\": \"{{origin}}/#clinic\",\n      \"name\": \"Soie Clinic\",\n      \"url\": \"{{origin}}/\",\n      \"address\": {\n        \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\n        \"addressLocality\": \"Cairo\",\n        \"addressCountry\": \"EG\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n  </script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"signature-site\">\n\n  <a href=\"#main\" class=\"skip-link\">Skip to content</a>\n\n  <header class=\"nav\" id=\"nav\">\n    <div class=\"nav__wrap\">\n      <a href=\"/\" class=\"nav__logo\" aria-label=\"Soie Clinic home\"><img src=\"/assets/images/logo.png\" alt=\"Soie Clinic\" width=\"68\" height=\"64\" /><span class=\"nav__logo-tag\">CLINIC</span></a>\n      <nav class=\"nav__links\" id=\"navLinks\" aria-label=\"Primary\">\n        <a href=\"/\" class=\"nav__link nav__link--secondary\">Home</a>\n        <a href=\"/about\" class=\"nav__link nav__link--secondary\">About</a>\n        <a href=\"/treatments\" class=\"nav__link\">Services</a>\n        <a href=\"/devices\" class=\"nav__link is-active\">Devices</a>\n        <a href=\"/results\" class=\"nav__link\">Before &amp; After</a>\n        <a href=\"/faq\" class=\"nav__link nav__link--secondary\">FAQ</a>\n        <a href=\"/contact\" class=\"nav__link\">Visit us</a>\n        <a href=\"/book\" class=\"btn btn--gold nav__menu-book\">Book appointment</a>\n      </nav>\n      <div class=\"language-switch\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Website language\" data-i18n-ignore>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-language=\"en\" lang=\"en\" aria-pressed=\"true\">English</button><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><button type=\"button\" data-language=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" aria-pressed=\"false\">العربية</button>\n      </div>\n      <a href=\"/book\" class=\"nav__cta\" data-open-booking>Book appointment</a>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"nav__burger\" id=\"burger\" data-i18n-live aria-label=\"Open menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"navLinks\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main id=\"main\">\n    <section class=\"page-hero\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <nav class=\"crumbs\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a> · <a href=\"/devices\">Devices</a> · <span>FineXel</span></nav>\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">FineXel at Soie Clinic · Cairo, Egypt</p>\n        <h1 class=\"page-hero__title\">FineXel fractional CO2 laser<br /><em>in Cairo.</em></h1>\n        <p class=\"page-hero__lede\">FineXel fractional CO2 laser is available at Soie Clinic in Cairo. Learn what resurfacing may offer for skin texture and acne scars, watch a session and discuss recovery before booking.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section device-section\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"device-feature device-feature--film\">\n          <div class=\"device-video__player\" id=\"finexel-video\">\n            <video class=\"film device-video__media\"\n              muted loop playsinline preload=\"none\"\n              poster=\"/assets/videos/posters/finexel-fractional-co2.jpg\"\n              data-film data-src=\"/assets/videos/finexel-fractional-co2.mp4\"\n              width=\"720\" height=\"1280\"\n              aria-label=\"FineXel fractional CO2 laser session at Soie Clinic\"></video>\n            <button class=\"film-toggle\" type=\"button\" data-media-toggle aria-label=\"Pause video\" aria-pressed=\"false\"></button>\n            <noscript><p><a href=\"/assets/videos/finexel-fractional-co2.mp4\">Watch the FineXel video</a></p></noscript>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"device-feature__body\">\n            <p class=\"eyebrow\">Available at Soie Clinic</p>\n            <h2>FineXel<br /><em>Fractional CO2 laser.</em></h2>\n            <p>Our FineXel device is used for fractional CO2 laser treatments. The laser treats small points of skin, leaving skin between them untreated. This approach is used for skin resurfacing.</p>\n            <p>Before a session, we assess your skin, discuss what you want to improve and explain the recovery time. Watch the video for a closer look at the device during treatment.</p>\n            <div class=\"device-tags\"><span>Fractional CO2</span><span>Skin resurfacing</span><span>Assessment comes first</span></div>\n            <button class=\"btn btn--gold\" data-open-booking>Ask about FineXel</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"device-topics\">\n          <article><span class=\"eyebrow\">01 / Texture</span><h2>Texture &amp; fine lines</h2><p>Fractional CO2 resurfacing may help improve uneven texture and some fine lines. The result and recovery depend on your skin, the area and treatment settings.</p></article>\n          <article><span class=\"eyebrow\">02 / Scars</span><h2>Acne scars</h2><p>Some acne scars may be treated with fractional CO2 laser. We assess the type and depth of scarring before discussing whether laser or another option is suitable.</p></article>\n          <article><span class=\"eyebrow\">03 / Recovery</span><h2>Time to heal</h2><p>Redness, swelling and peeling can follow treatment, and downtime varies. We explain cleansing, moisturising and sun protection, along with when to contact the clinic.</p></article>\n        </div>\n        <section class=\"device-faq\" id=\"device-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"finexel-faq-title\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">Before your visit</p>\n          <h2 id=\"finexel-faq-title\">FineXel, <em>explained.</em></h2>\n          <details><summary>Does Soie Clinic have a FineXel device?</summary><p>Yes. The video shows our FineXel fractional CO2 laser at Soie Clinic. Contact us to confirm the branch and arrange a consultation.</p></details>\n<details><summary>What is fractional CO2 laser?</summary><p>It is a skin resurfacing treatment that applies CO2 laser energy to small areas in a pattern, leaving skin between them untreated. The treatment settings are chosen after a medical assessment.</p></details>\n<details><summary>What can fractional CO2 laser help with?</summary><p>It may be considered for certain acne scars, uneven texture and fine lines. Suitability depends on the concern and your skin. Results vary, and more than one session may be needed.</p></details>\n<details><summary>How much recovery time will I need?</summary><p>Recovery depends on the treatment depth, area and your skin. Redness, swelling, peeling and sensitivity can last for several days, with redness sometimes lasting longer. We will discuss timing and aftercare before you book.</p></details>\n<details><summary>Is fractional CO2 laser suitable for everyone?</summary><p>No. We review your skin tone, healing history, medicines and recent procedures. Tell us about active skin infections, cold sores, pregnancy and recent tanning. We will explain possible risks, including pigment changes and scarring, and whether another approach would suit you.</p></details>\n<details><summary>How many FineXel sessions will I need?</summary><p>There is no single course for everyone. We suggest a plan after assessing your skin and goals, then review your response before recommending further sessions.</p></details>\n\n          <details><summary>How much does fractional CO2 laser cost in Cairo?</summary><p>The price depends on the area and the treatment plan recommended after assessing your skin. Contact Soie Clinic for current costs, branch availability and advice on planning your recovery.</p></details>\n        </section>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section cta-band\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <h2 class=\"cta-band__title\">Considering fractional laser?<br /><em>Talk to our team.</em></h2>\n        <p class=\"cta-band__sub\">Tell us about your skin concern and ask about FineXel at Soie Clinic. We will help you confirm the branch and arrange a consultation.</p>\n        <div class=\"cta-band__actions\"><button class=\"btn btn--gold btn--lg\" data-open-booking>Ask about FineXel</button><a class=\"btn btn--ghost btn--lg\" href=\"/devices\">Explore our devices</a></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n<aside class=\"device-related container\" aria-labelledby=\"related-title\"><h2 id=\"related-title\">Other devices at Soie Clinic</h2><div class=\"device-related__links\"><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/devices/indiba-deep-care\">INDIBA Deep Care <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></a><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/devices/cutera-excel-hr\">Cutera excel HR <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></a><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/devices\">Browse all devices <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></a></div></aside>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer class=\"footer\">\n    <div class=\"container signature-footer-cta\"><h2>Your next step starts here.</h2><a class=\"btn btn--gold\" href=\"/book\" data-open-booking>Book appointment <svg class=\"btn__arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 2